Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:06.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On the day we decided to depart,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.52,0:00:09.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we burned down our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:20.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, are you sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:20.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.98,0:00:24.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leaving the village, I mean. \NYou don't have any regrets?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.10,0:00:26.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.10,0:00:29.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We decided to do this ourselves, \Nyou know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:31.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Actually, I think you're the one \Nwho'll miss it more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.62,0:00:35.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm all excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.11,0:00:38.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm going to \Nbecome a State Alchemist! Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.58,0:00:41.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.66,0:00:44.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get your body fixed, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.70,0:00:48.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all right. You just need to worry about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.17,0:00:53.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, how do we get to be State Alchemists?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.95,0:00:55.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What kind of training does it take?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.05,0:01:01.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If they performed human transmutation
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.54,0:01:04.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and escaped with their lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.40,0:01:08.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then I am more interested in them. \NThey could make fine State Alchemists.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.58,0:01:13.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, we're going to go meet this Roy person.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:18.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who knows? With talent as abundant as mine is,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.80,0:01:20.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it'll be a piece of cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.11,0:01:25.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you concerned about Winry?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.20,0:01:32.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing we can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.82,0:01:35.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's something those two have set their minds to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.28,0:01:37.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll be back \Nonce they grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.02,0:01:39.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.38,0:01:40.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.86,0:01:45.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything \Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.55,0:01:50.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything, \Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.87,0:01:55.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's \NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.63,0:02:01.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that \Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.01,0:03:57.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, do you know which train we're supposed to transfer to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:03:59.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's coming at nine o'clock tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.68,0:04:01.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Until then, let's get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:03.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.39,0:04:05.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:10.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was a cinch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.65,0:04:15.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kids, huh? Off to bed with you now, \Nlike good boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:21.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.40,0:04:27.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't {\i1}you{\i0} give it a rest there, instead?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.39,0:04:29.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nicely done!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.70,0:04:32.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.70,0:04:35.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was that strange power just now alchemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:37.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.36,0:04:41.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To think that boys your age could be alchemists!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.42,0:04:47.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In these parts, Majhal would have to be the only alchemist around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.02,0:04:48.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Majhal?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.26,0:04:52.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure. It's said that he has helped others out many times with his alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.77,0:04:54.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's quite well respected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.75,0:04:56.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is this person?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.98,0:04:59.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, the next village over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.12,0:05:02.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you'd better not go there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.19,0:05:04.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's this ominous rumor going around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.04,0:05:07.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The rumor has it that dead people
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:10.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are coming back to life in that village and attacking the villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.81,0:05:16.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know about this Majhal person, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.92,0:05:22.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, but I saw that same name among all those letters of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.13,0:05:23.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean Dad's?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.33,0:05:27.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I remember, he wrote about human transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.13,0:05:30.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it's the same person, \Nit couldn't hurt to meet him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.04,0:05:34.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah! This seems like \Nit's going to be a good trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.44,0:05:38.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sure seem unusually happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:43.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, we did catch that purse-snatcher, and everyone congratulated us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.84,0:05:45.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how to say this,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.08,0:05:49.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I'm happy that our alchemy was able to help others out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.50,0:06:01.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.35,0:06:03.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.48,0:06:06.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That seat was hard and bounced around something awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.38,0:06:08.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You weren't bothered?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.32,0:06:09.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.02,0:06:13.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.67,0:06:16.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,those are some incredible decorations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:18.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is there some festival going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.65,0:06:23.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yikes! That one went toward the village!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.00,0:06:26.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?! This place is off-limits!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.98,0:06:29.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're in the middle of \Na fireworks rehearsal here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.05,0:06:31.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,F-Fireworks?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.54,0:06:33.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.12,0:06:35.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The fireworks for the festival, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.45,0:06:38.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never seen your faces before, have I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.01,0:06:43.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's with this guy? \NHe's got a strange outfit on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.13,0:06:44.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.55,0:06:47.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's get 'em. Should be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.02,0:07:00.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We got 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.43,0:07:01.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.47,0:07:03.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.29,0:07:17.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you Majhal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.90,0:07:25.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.74,0:07:28.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An impressive spirit bonding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:30.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-He knows about me, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:33.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just what you'd expect of Hohenheim's sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.25,0:07:37.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently, you've inherited his great talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.77,0:07:41.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now then, what can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.56,0:07:47.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't very well turn down the \Nrequest of the sons of a dear friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.67,0:07:50.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We wanted to ask about the human transmutation you wrote about
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.96,0:07:53.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,in the letter you sent him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.36,0:07:54.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Human transmutation?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.75,0:07:59.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You do know that it is \Nforbidden by law, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.16,0:08:00.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.86,0:08:05.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I want to return \NAl's body back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.30,0:08:11.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The costs accompanying a human transmutation are altogether too great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.90,0:08:13.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know how you must feel,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.62,0:08:17.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but such an act is something that only God is allowed to perform.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.01,0:08:21.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why did you correspond with him \Nabout human transmutation?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.12,0:08:25.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Youthful enthusiasm...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.15,0:08:26.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess you would call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.73,0:08:32.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Majhal-sama,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.90,0:08:37.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made some rose jam, \Nif you'd like some.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.24,0:08:39.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm always grateful, Lebi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.72,0:08:40.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.75,0:08:42.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.17,0:08:45.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was there something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.90,0:08:48.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No. E-Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.50,0:08:50.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay then, take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.49,0:09:03.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to mention it, there's a festival happening soon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.68,0:09:06.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the Requiem Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.66,0:09:11.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The spirits of the dead are sent up \Non fireworks, to return them to Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.94,0:09:14.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've heard rumors about this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.90,0:09:18.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They say the dead are coming back to life \Nand attacking people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.00,0:09:19.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does that have anything to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.10,0:09:23.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's just a silly, baseless rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.87,0:09:29.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My, my, I'm certainly having a lot of visitors today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.20,0:09:31.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.18,0:09:33.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, Clause!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.54,0:09:36.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Majhal-sama, I'm really sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.19,0:09:40.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to apologize?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.05,0:09:42.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's their own fault for being so weak, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.33,0:09:43.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For boys, anyhow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:46.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:46.02,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Brother, control yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.33,0:09:50.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clause, I know that you're upset about your sister's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.37,0:09:53.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you were once \Nsuch a gentle little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.82,0:09:58.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What would your late sister think if she saw you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.00,0:09:58.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.95,0:10:01.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nobody knows how I feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.08,0:10:04.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My sister didn't just die—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.31,0:10:07.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she was killed when that lady came back to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:08.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Came back to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:12.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clause!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.48,0:10:18.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.26,0:10:39.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys are...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.61,0:10:41.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,alchemists?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.32,0:10:48.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been half a year \Nsince my sister died.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.06,0:10:50.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We didn't know the cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.13,0:10:52.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One of the villagers found her as they were passing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:55.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She looking like she was asleep, but she was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.40,0:10:57.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then, on the night of her funeral...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.45,0:11:07.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clause...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.86,0:11:20.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,K-Karin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.10,0:11:32.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dad said that she was a woman who lived in this village a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.32,0:11:37.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, right? The dead woman \Ncame back to life and killed my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.74,0:11:39.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And not only her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.65,0:11:42.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all because of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.52,0:11:47.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, if you're alchemists, then avenge her for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.90,0:11:51.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've asked Majhal-san, \Nbut he won't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.12,0:11:55.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's only natural that \NMajhal-san won't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.79,0:12:00.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's because your story is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.75,0:12:03.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, I'm not too wild \Nabout taking any revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.70,0:12:05.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.90,0:12:07.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys are really just scared, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.20,0:12:09.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you call yourselves alchemists!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.86,0:12:12.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're just a pipsqueak and an armor fanatic!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.35,0:12:13.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pipsqueak?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.28,0:12:14.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Armor fanatic?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.79,0:12:18.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you call me a pipsqueak! \NI'm still going to grow up ultra-big!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.85,0:12:20.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a pipsqueak now, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.15,0:12:23.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pipsqueak! Pipsqueak! Ultra-hyper-super-pipsqueak!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.10,0:12:24.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.30,0:12:27.89,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,What about you?! If you're a girl, \Nwhy don't you at least dress a little like one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.84,0:12:30.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,None of your business!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.75,0:12:39.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Karin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.30,0:12:43.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, she did live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:46.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She made a living by raising flowers,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.26,0:12:48.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and she was a beautiful woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.07,0:12:52.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It must be twenty years ago now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.08,0:12:57.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She succeeded in cultivating a very difficult blue rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.54,0:13:00.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Her smile at the time was simply...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.76,0:13:01.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.50,0:13:07.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,while she was riding in a carriage, \Nshipping her blue roses to the city...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.25,0:13:16.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she fell down along the \Nmountain roads and died there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.81,0:13:20.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But they say that this Karin-san is attacking the villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.39,0:13:22.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way that could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.47,0:13:24.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The dead do not come back to life, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.20,0:13:27.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And besides, even if she \Nwere to come back to life,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.70,0:13:31.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it's inconceivable that she would attack the other villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:34.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.95,0:13:37.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's true, dead people \Ndon't come back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.66,0:13:41.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But supposing that someone were to perform a human transmutation...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.37,0:13:45.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The only person in this village who would be capable of that is Majhal-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.58,0:13:54.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.76,0:13:55.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hear what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.48,0:14:00.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're really going to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.19,0:14:05.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're going to catch this \NKarin zombie with our own hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.64,0:14:08.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, are you afraid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.34,0:14:11.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone else will probably get killed if this keeps up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.86,0:14:13.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:18.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jeez, what are you doing, old lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.08,0:14:19.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.25,0:14:21.95,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,I don't need your money, just go, would you? \NYou can't just stay here all day
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.95,0:14:23.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, we make our \Nmove tonight. Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.95,0:14:23.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,over one bowl of soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.55,0:14:28.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.51,0:14:30.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.01,0:14:32.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Al? Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.64,0:14:37.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not that. There aren't really any zombies around, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:39.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.40,0:14:43.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the rumors are true, then it could only be by human transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.30,0:14:45.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's worth checking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.84,0:14:48.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.70,0:14:50.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We caught her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.00,0:14:56.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're hurting me, Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.93,0:15:00.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.37,0:15:02.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:15.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You{\i0}... took my sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.92,0:15:16.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clause!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.15,0:15:38.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That sound...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.30,0:15:43.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The alchemist Majhal...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:44.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Second-rate after all, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.40,0:15:58.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's Majhal-sama for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.10,0:16:02.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Majhal-sama, I knew you would put down that zombie for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.11,0:16:10.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.32,0:16:13.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was neither a zombie \Nnor a human transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.38,0:16:17.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was the same sound that I heard that other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.95,0:16:22.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Majhal-sama will be cross with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.60,0:16:25.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,wandering around his residence on your own like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.67,0:16:28.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.72,0:16:35.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.38,0:16:42.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.44,0:16:46.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.74,0:16:56.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.20,0:16:59.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, you're awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.24,0:17:03.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It appears that you've seen something that you shouldn't have seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.33,0:17:07.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I saw. The identity of that zombie, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.05,0:17:08.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is your doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.60,0:17:12.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, spirit bonding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.76,0:17:18.97,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,I take a mannequin that is the perfect likeness of Karin and bond one of the village girls to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.97,0:17:22.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By doing so, they were supposed to resemble a living Karin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.59,0:17:24.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you failed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.99,0:17:29.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spirits do not tend to bond to vessels that are unlike them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.45,0:17:33.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You may think they are bonded, \Nbut ordinarily, they are not functional.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.68,0:17:35.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There were even those who \Nslipped out of here on their own
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.84,0:17:38.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and wandered around the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.92,0:17:41.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you realize what you've done?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.55,0:17:43.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why the hell would you do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.43,0:17:47.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Karin was the only woman I ever loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.05,0:17:53.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter how many years pass since Karin's death, my scars will not heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.75,0:17:55.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made up my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.90,0:17:59.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that I would bring Karin \Nback to life through alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.24,0:18:03.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, it was impossible for me to perform human transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.92,0:18:07.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That being the case, I wanted to at least create something that was close to Karin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.64,0:18:10.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.01,0:18:13.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.07,0:18:17.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! I just love Karin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.52,0:18:19.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to assist me now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.75,0:18:23.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,in a spiritual bonding for my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.86,0:18:25.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.30,0:18:30.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Indeed. You're just as stubborn as Hohenheim was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.12,0:18:37.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, I wanted to thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.92,0:18:39.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You foolish girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.10,0:18:40.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.38,0:18:45.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please stop, Majhal-sama! \NEnd this already!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.47,0:18:48.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up! This has nothing to do with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:52.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, do something, fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.60,0:18:56.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a little more...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.22,0:19:05.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A blue rose?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.66,0:19:14.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Receive this girl's spirit and smile \Nupon me this time without fail, Karin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.45,0:19:17.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.52,0:19:24.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop, Majhal!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.24,0:19:26.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't understand a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.32,0:19:28.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What you were seeking \Nhas been right next to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.89,0:19:30.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.73,0:19:33.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Karin-san didn't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.42,0:19:38.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After the accident, she lost her memory and lived from then on someplace else!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.38,0:19:39.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then, twenty years later,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.85,0:19:44.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Karin-san got her memory back and came straight back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.32,0:19:47.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you didn't realize it was her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.15,0:19:55.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Majhal...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.24,0:19:56.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.60,0:19:59.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that this woman is Karin?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.85,0:20:03.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Karin was more beautiful than any other woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.48,0:20:05.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like a rose!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.01,0:20:06.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Face reality!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.31,0:20:08.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Flowers wither.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.87,0:20:12.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Karin-san's feelings \Ntoward you have not changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.86,0:20:16.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Silence! Say one more word, \Nand I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.73,0:20:51.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Majhal! Majhal!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.64,0:20:54.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.14,0:20:57.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are not... Karin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.40,0:21:03.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way... you could be Karin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.10,0:21:32.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you moping about, Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.12,0:21:39.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was thinking that alchemy can also delude people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.26,0:21:43.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.45,0:21:52.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.56,0:21:57.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.58,0:22:01.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really are terrific alchemists, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.80,0:22:04.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That may be so,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.38,0:22:05.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.67,0:22:08.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're... Clause?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.05,0:22:15.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "Ehhh!"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.79,0:22:23.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You definitely look better in those clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.90,0:22:24.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.84,0:23:40.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.87,0:23:44.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 5: "Dash! Automail"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.58,0:23:46.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You wanted power too, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.78,0:23:51.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what the man with the mechanical arm said to me.
